<title>USA: Dow drops more than 50 points.</title>
<headline>Dow drops more than 50 points.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dow Jones industrial average lost more than 50 points in midafternoon trading Tuesday as investors grew nervous ahead of the release Wednesday of key retail sales data and the producer price index for July.</p>
<p>At 2:38 p.m. EDT, the Dow was off 50.40 points at 8,011.71, which activated the New York Stock Exchange's limits on programme trading.</p>
